*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0603CS-1N6
* Inductance = 1.6nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-25.3GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0603CS-1N6 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.03pF Ind=1.6nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=2
+ R2=0.001
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000065
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0603CS-1N6

